	"data": "Goal: Spatial Authoring\n\nCreate, edit, connect, and delete thought bubbles by hand in VR. The core authoring experience.\n\nWhat This Is\nThe thing that doesn't exist yet. Every other goal feeds into this. A spatial editor where you build knowledge graphs by grabbing, placing, and connecting nodes in 3D space — not by typing markdown in a flat editor.\n\nSpecific Behaviors Needed\nCreate bubble — pull from a palette or pinch empty space to spawn a new bubble\nEdit content — tap a bubble to open a…",
